ze, Type and Last Modified. I also tested the directory sort modes, grid view, rotation, and adding, editing and deleting bookmarks. All three reports got \"could not reproduce\", so none are logged. (1) A bookmark added from the three-dot menu showed in the drawer, but disappeared after rotating the device. I saw this three times. The built-in bookmarks (DCIM, Download and so on) stayed. (2) With \"None On Top\" and Last Modified descending, folder Alpha was listed under the \"Files\" heading. Nothing else I tried looked wrong, but I did not test cut/move paste or the Hidden Files option."}}, "tool_use_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01Rz4671xL3y1XPVR7EiYQAf", "display_name": "Sign Off", "server_display_name": "aqb-device", "tool_name": "sign_off"}]}
